%% guardrails built-in — PreToolUse decision pipeline (v1)
flowchart TD
    A[PreToolUse envelope] --> B{tool == Bash?}
    B -->|no| Z1[allow — pass through]
    B -->|yes| C[load rule packs]
    C --> D{any rule matches?}
    D -->|no| Z1
    D -->|yes| E{rule.mode}

    E -->|allow| Z1
    E -->|block| F[deny + reason]
    E -->|rewrite| G[apply rewrite strategy]
    G --> H{destructive?}
    H -->|no| Z2[allow with rewrite]
    H -->|yes| I[backup before exec]
    I --> J{backup ok?}
    J -->|no| F
    J -->|yes| Z2

    E -->|hitl| K[ask user via stderr]
    K --> L{approved?}
    L -->|no| F
    L -->|yes| H

    E -->|manager / peer-N| M[publish inbox_message_added]
    M --> N[return deferred]
    N --> O[(bus inbox)]
    O --> P{N approvals OR timeout?}
    P -->|approved| H
    P -->|timeout / denied| F

    style F fill:#f88,stroke:#c00,color:#000
    style Z1 fill:#8f8,stroke:#080,color:#000
    style Z2 fill:#8f8,stroke:#080,color:#000
    style I fill:#fc8,stroke:#a60,color:#000
    style M fill:#88f,stroke:#008,color:#fff
